segmented-linear-assignment
Copyright 2026 segmented-linear-assignment contributors

The implementation is informed by torch-linear-assignment by Ivan Karpukhin,
which is distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
https://github.com/ivan-chai/torch-linear-assignment

Both projects implement the rectangular shortest augmenting path algorithm
described by D. F. Crouse, "On implementing 2D rectangular assignment
algorithms", IEEE Transactions on Aerospace and Electronic Systems 52(4),
2016, doi:10.1109/TAES.2016.140952.

This project extends the execution model and storage layout for variable-size
grouped jobs, packed workspaces, and size-adaptive cooperative CUDA blocks. The
solver keeps the upstream floating-point dtype and shortest augmenting path
arithmetic.
